{"title":"Categoria:Minerals","sourceTitle":"Category:Minerals/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Category:Minerals\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Category:Minerals (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Minerals/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Categoría:Minerales (100% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Minerals/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Category:Minéraux (100% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Minerals/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Категория: Минералы (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Minerals/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"类别：矿物 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<p>Minerais são itens encontrados no subsolo que têm diversos usos, desde a elaboração até a agricultura e a fundição. Os minerais podem estar associados a diferentes estratos rochosos. Os minerais são diferentes de outros minérios porque não podem ser fundidos em metal (embora possam estar envolvidos em processos de fundição).\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111120920\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument s